00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:07.080
8 - 4 = 61.(lol wut?)

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:12.360
The challenge is to move only 2 sticks to make a correct equation.(oh ok)

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.820
I thank Dvir, who created this problem and sent it to me.

00:00:17.725 --> 00:00:20.645
I admit, this puzzle fooled me!

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:23.715
You're only allowed to move 2 sticks to make a correct equation.

00:00:23.835 --> 00:00:27.325
You may also have to change your perspective to solve this one.

00:00:27.695 --> 00:00:30.645
Pause the video if you'd like to give this problem a try,

00:00:30.645 --> 00:00:31.700
and when you're ready,

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.580
keep watching to learn how to solve this problem.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.360
So here's the answer:

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:51.960
First, we'll make the 4 into a 11 by moving this stick.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.360
Then, we'll make this = sign into a - sign,

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:59.380
and vice versa by moving this one stick.(also liveoverflow is best channel)

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:01.880
And this is the correct answer.

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:07.520
Now, you might say, "8 = 11 - 61 is NOT the correct equation!"

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.060
BUT,  to get the correct equation,

00:01:10.065 --> 00:01:12.185
you have to change your perspective.

00:01:12.495 --> 00:01:15.225
Look at this equation upside down.

00:01:15.665 --> 00:01:16.595
To illustrate this,

00:01:16.595 --> 00:01:19.505
I'm going to rotate the entire diagram

00:01:19.505 --> 00:01:22.475
so you can see what it would look like upside down.

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:25.380
You then get the equation

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:28.695
19 - 11 = 8,

00:01:28.695 --> 00:01:30.765
and that's the correct answer!

00:01:31.565 --> 00:01:34.445
So the next time you're stuck on a problem,

00:01:34.455 --> 00:01:36.385
take a step back,

00:01:36.385 --> 00:01:38.460
and consider changing your perspective.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:40.520
It might make all the difference!

